// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Pither 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Efficiency Expert Pither 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P702918583" "Efficiency Expert Pither"
// ProfessionString :
"P152956294" "Arachnos Efficiency Expert"
// DescriptionString :
"P197397496" "Mr. Pither is a small-minded and petty man, who would have led a mean and meaningless life if he had not found his one true calling: Efficiency. He was so dedicated to this task that it started to cost the lives of inefficient workers, in accidents that would have been avoided had they followed his efficiency regimen, of course. Lord Recluse came upon him when he volunteered a more efficient way to defeat a hero in mid-battle. Recluse offered him a job, and now Mr. Pither is one of the most feared men in Arachnos. Mr. Pither has a wife and three children, all of whose lives he runs like clockwork.<br><br>Working for Mr. Pither can earn you the Efficiency Expert badge by completing all of his timed missions successfully. <color orange>You must succeed at all the timed missions and be the Mission Owner, or use the Mission Autocomplete feature, to earn the badge. Simply helping another villain complete these missions will not earn you the badge.</color>"
// HelloString :
"P670596584" "State your business."
// HelloString :
"P1125830723" "Hmmm?"
// HelloString :
"P2262894734" "This better be quick, I've got a schedule to keep."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1820623306" "And you are...?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P173963949" "I was told to expect you, {VillainName}. Let's make this quick, I have a schedule to keep."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1733988393" "Well, that's all I have scheduled for you to do... perhaps your other associates have something?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P381675465" "I've looked at your schedules, and I can't reasonably give you anything to do until you clear some time for it."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1928136087" "What I need done takes a person of a higher threat level than you can offer right now."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2140001212" "Ok, you've proven to me you can get done what needs to be done."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1011397514" "If you keep this up, you are going to put me out of a job."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2550035272" "Your talents would be wasted here, a better use of your talents would be somewhere else."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3201396838" "There is this one employee Lord Recluse keeps around, his name is Pither, or 'Arachnos Efficiency Expert Pither' as he likes to be called. He has some tasks that need to be taken care of, and has been keeping logs on you. Mr. Pither would love for you to work for him.<br><br>Working for Mr. Pither can earn you the Efficiency Expert badge by completing all of his timed missions successfully. <color orange>You must succeed at all the timed missions and be the Mission Owner, or use the Mission Autocomplete feature, to earn the badge. Simply helping another villain complete these missions will not earn you the badge.</color>"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3932985896" "Pick Mr. Pither"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3005080874" "Mr. Pither runs a tight ship, so don't disappoint him. Getting his jobs done can lead to bigger and better things."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


