// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Shadow Spider 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3933719368" "Shadow Spider"
// ProfessionString :
"P3209523340" "Arachnos Spymaster"
// DescriptionString :
"P828426514" "Shadow Spider began her career as a Knife of Artemis, specializing in infiltration and intelligence jobs that no one thought possible. Now working with Arachnos, Shadow Spider acts friendly and nice, and is usually very good to her people, but can turn cold as ice and hard as steel when she needs to be. "
// HelloString :
"P4149958838" "Keep a low profile, {VillainName}."
// HelloString :
"P3962969706" "We've got a mission, {VillainName}."
// HelloString :
"P3116189162" "Let's get started, shall we?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3045258506" "Have you ever heard the term 'covert ops'? Make yourself scarce. Unless I get the word from someone I trust, like Zuhkara, I don't know you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3974500060" "My code-name is Shadow Spider, I deal with Arachnos covert ops, and that's all you need to know about me. Do a good job and you'll get a good pay-off. Cross me, and I get angry."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1173826684" "Our work is done, {VillainName}. Speak to no one about what we have done."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P337245789" "Your current activities are drawing far too much attention. You need to settle some of your other affairs before we continue."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1669027037" "You're not classified for the next mission. Come back when you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P560852527" "You do decent work, {VillainName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P50681418" "There's more to you than meets the eye, {VillainName}. I like that."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2751730599" "We're done here, {VillainName}. It's been a pleasure."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2855321985" "Have you heard of Shadow Spider? Considering her line of work, I'm not surprised. She deals with covert ops for Arachnos, and she's looking for someone relatively capable to accomplish some work for her."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1487335915" "Choose Shadow Spider"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3685998987" "As long as you are professional and competent, Shadow Spider will treat you well. Cross her and you might get yourself in trouble."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


