// Name :
"P3681782251" "Tavish Bell"
// ProfessionString :
"P3108995477" "Crey Security Chief"
// DescriptionString :
"P1424483062" "Tavish Bell has worked for Crey for years, so he knows where all the bodies are buried. That information has got him the cush job of overseeing their outside security contracts. These contracts are with individuals with powers and abilities far beyond that which Crey can muscle together. These contract workers handle the jobs that Crey can't handle for themselves."
// HelloString :
"P2205487213" "Hello again, {VillainName}."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2457522423" "Beat it before I call some Protectors here to kick your butt."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2453768458" "You must be my new Contract, {VillainName}. I hope you are up for the tasks at hand."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2323744530" "We're done. Contract's up. Enjoy your pay."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1353108319" "Finish what you are dealing with first"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P798050764" "I only work with the best, and that isn't you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3427523838" "You're doing well."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2340861187" "I've put your name in for a bonus."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P997049177" "Crey can't afford the likes of you."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P252911964" "Tavish Bell is a Crey Security Chief in charge of sub-contracting their security to independent operators like yourself."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4100928538" "Work for Crey under Tavish Bell"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3728140477" "Tavish expects results. Don't disappoint."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
