// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Television 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Television 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P619799315" "Television"
// ProfessionString :
"P1738550320" "Television"
// DescriptionString :
"P2782138068" "This looks like a perfectly normal television. Sitting, propped up on bricks and boards in the gutter. That somehow gets reception. And isn't plugged into anything. You've seen stranger things, but this is definitely weird."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P1798100487" "As you watch the flickering screen, you can't help but think how great it would feel to be on Television. It would be like you were the master of the airwaves. Lord Recluse must feel like that every day, looking out from the top of his tower. And just as you think about it, the Television is showing an image from the top of Recluse's tower right here in Grandville, and you find yourself thinking that maybe you should climb up there yourself..."
// HelloString :
"P3908722455" "The Television turns on as you approach."
// HelloString :
"P63062669" "The Television changes channels as you approach."
// HelloString :
"P2971082410" "A strange test pattern flashes across the screen, establishing control over the horizontal and the vertical, then the screen returns to normal."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2602224188" "You tune in the TV to find something to watch, but all you see are commercials for shows that will be on later. There's nothing to watch right now."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4287728473" "This is the first time you really have a chance to sit down and watch some TV. Fortunately, there's an easy channel guide to show what's on. You make your first choice and change channels, but it doesn't take you to the show you chose. Still, you get the feeling that you should watch what's on anyway."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P616717252" "You click from channel to channel, but there isn't anything on you want to watch. Typical."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4162462144" "You start looking for something to watch, but random bits of shows keep reminding you of all the other missions you have to do. Maybe once you've finished some of your other missions, you'll have time to watch TV again."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P338563220" "Just as a show is about to start, the signal breaks up into a test pattern with a title card that says: 'Technical difficulties. Please stand by. Service will return at Threat Level 45.'"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1655594168" "You see a commercial for a new service that will let you watch TV on your cellphone. That could be really handy. You take down the information. Now you can never be separated from Television."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2681622762" "You should never see this text"
// LocationString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


