// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Vernon_Von_Grun 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Vernon von Grun 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2885453895" "Vernon von Grun"
// ProfessionString :
"P458803900" "Arachnos Lab assistant"
// DescriptionString :
"P4044589688" "Vernon von Grun is a lowly lab technician working on the least prestigious part of Project Fury: Plant/Human hybrids. Rumors say that he's become jealous of Operative Grillo, and feels that he, Vernon von Grun, deserves to be more than a mere lab assistant! To that end, he's hatched an evil scheme."
// HelloString :
"P349483680" "They laughed at me in school. Laughed! At me!"
// HelloString :
"P2612569407" "I'll show them 'radical theories'. I'll show them all!"
// HelloString :
"P1322912202" "Soon the whole world will rue this day!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P787295789" "Oh, you must be {VillainName}. I am afraid that as a *grumble* 'mere lab-assistant', I have nothing that can be of interest to you. Oh, but just you wait. Yes, just wait! They said my theories were 'impractical'. The fools! They did not understand real genius even while it bides it's time cleaning their lab equipment! But one day, I'll show them! I'll show them all the power of my theories and of my amazing Scientific Mind! <br><br>AH-HAH-HAH-HAH-HAH-HAAAA!!! <br><br>Uh, I mean, I'm just an ordinary lab assistant. And NOTHING more. Perhaps you should talk to Terence Dobbs or Dr. Forrester."
// FirstVisitString :
"P169914625" "My name is Vernon von Grun, and I am a lab assistant. But I will not have my scientific genius confined to cleaning glassware for much longer. No! Though I now toil away as a mere lab assistant on Project: FURY, soon I will be ready to demonstrate my theories. Soon, I will be ready to show all of those who mocked my work! All I need is the right aid. The aid of a powerful villain capable of carrying out the necessary experiments to prove my theories once and for all! To make them have to accept me and my work at the pinnacle of SCIENCE!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1802063977" "I'm sorry, {VillainName}, but after all that's happened, I have so much to do! It's been very exciting working with you on my old theories, but even though our work together finally let me become a true Mad Scientist, now I realize I need to re-evaluate them. I simply hadn't taken human factors into account. Wait! That's it! Of course, it all makes sense now! I'll simply have to eliminate all humans from the equation! It would be tricky, but for science nothing is impossible! You'll see one day, {VillainName}! I'll show them all!"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2344036369" "How can you possibly hope to follow along with my experiments when you're already over-burdened with so much work? Science requires a clear and sharply focused mind, {VillainName}!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2314778056" "Yes, {VillainName}, yes. Dr. Forrester did mention you. But I can clearly see with my astute powers of scientific observation that you're not quite ready to handle my more advance theories. Science waits for no one, but you must wait until you're at least level 45 for science!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4133033787" "You handled that very well, and have shown an incredible natural acumen for science. To call our meeting fate would be to slight the laws of probability. No, this work of ours, this work we're doing is too important to minimize it so. Take my cellular telephone number. In experiments so vital, so precise, seconds can matter!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2112352776" "Soon, the experiments will be done! In the annals of science, I will make certain that your name will be there with mine. That way when future generations of scientists look back on what we were able to accomplish, they'll know that they too must acquire the services of a villain of your caliber to make the kinds of legendary experiments we are creating here!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P60642967" "It's scientifically impossible for you to see this text! IMPOSSIBLE!"
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2179287035" "I was wondering if you might be interested in meeting one of the rising lights in the field of mad science? He's only a lab assistant at the moment, but I think Vernon von Grun will make mad scientist soon enough, and I think your unquestionable skill at harming others would be a big asset to his schemes. Interested?"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2247514418" "Choose Vernon von Grun"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3785161009" "Very good. Vernon currently works for Operative Grillo on a sub-section of Project: FURY involving plant/human hybrids and reverse evolution."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


