// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Viridian 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Viridian 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P522392490" "Viridian"
// ProfessionString :
"P2870761527" "Arachnos intelligence"
// DescriptionString :
"P2667948066" "Viridian is a very dangerous man who works subtle deals that can change the course of world history. The core of his job is influencing other villain gouprs through manipulation, sabotage, deal brokering, or collaboration, as it suits the needs of Arachnos. There is some rivalry between his organization of manipulators and Shadow Spiders' spies, but both know that they can only succeed at their job with the help of the other."
// BadgeNeededString :
"P964626074" "I need to know that you've got what it takes if you're going to work with me. You want to show me you're ready? Then listen up. Do what I tell you, and maybe I'll be able to use you:"
// BadgeFirstTick :
"P347083108" "Here's what I need for proof that you're up to the job: <br>Get the Tracer badge. You get it by defeating Tsoo Sorcerers. <br>Also get the Tank Buster badge. You get it by defeating Freakshow bosses. <br>The Infiltrator badge, too. Fight those Paragon Protector clones of Crey's. In fact, make sure you've taken out at least 200 Crey in general. <br>Yeah, and make sure you've taken out at least 200 Council agents. <br>That should about do it. When you got all of that, then we can talk. <br>See you around. Hah!"
// BadgeSecondTick :
"P3844353508" "I need someone who can fulfill all of my requirements. You're closer than most, but you're not there yet. I'll remind you of all that you need to do: <br>Get the Tracer badge. You get it by defeating Tsoo Sorcerers. <br>Also get the Tank Buster badge. You get it by defeating Freakshow bosses. <br>The Infiltrator badge, too. Fight those Paragon Protector clones of Crey's. In fact, make sure you've taken out at least 200 Crey in general. <br>Yeah, and make sure you've taken out at least 200 Council agents. <br>That should about do it. When you got all of that, then we can talk. See you around. Hah!"
// BadgeThirdTick :
"P964646267" "You're almost to what you need to meet my requirements for an agent. I'll list everything again, just so you know what to shoot for: <br>Get the Tracer badge. You get it by defeating Tsoo Sorcerers. <br>Also get the Tank Buster badge. You get it by defeating Freakshow bosses. <br>The Infiltrator badge, too. Fight those Paragon Protector clones of Crey's. In fact, make sure you've taken out at least 200 Crey in general. <br>Yeah, and make sure you've taken out at least 200 Council agents. <br>That should about do it. When you got all of that, then we can talk. See you around. Hah!"
// BadgeFourthTick :
"P3674759479" "You almost got it, but I'll give you the list again. Do all of this to prove you have what it takes to work with me: <br>Get the Tracer badge. You get it by defeating Tsoo Sorcerers. <br>Also get the Tank Buster badge. You get it by defeating Freakshow bosses. <br>The Infiltrator badge, too. Fight those Paragon Protector clones of Crey's. In fact, make sure you've taken out at least 200 Crey in general. <br>Yeah, and make sure you've taken out at least 200 Council agents. <br>That should about do it. When you got all of that, then we can talk. See you around. Hah!"
// HelloString :
"P1413577497" "Just listen."
// HelloString :
"P1973018331" "I don't have time. Be quiet."
// HelloString :
"P1202519137" "You want to know what's happening? Then shut up."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P997486675" "It's better for you if you just walk away."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3062456007" "Here's the deal: I don't normally work with your type. Villains, I mean. Too loud, too unstable. But I have an operation where you could be a major asset. A lot of people fear and respect you. A message delivered by you could carry far more weight to the recepient. And right now, what I need is impact. I don't explain myself, and I don't slow down, and I don't care what you have to say. Take the job or not, that's the only option."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1516210086" "I don't have a use for you anymore. But you held up your part. Good working with you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P893019838" "Don't insult me. My jobs need your full attention. Finish your other work, then come back."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P540269599" "You're just not good enough yet. Come back when you're at least Threat Level 45."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3480664807" "You did okay."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P579131738" "You did good."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2263096631" "No one should ever read this."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2132371490" "No one should ever see this"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

